    "body": "### Vision statement / What / Requirements\r\nAdd the legacy telemetry client id to the deletion request ping to comply with data protection regulations (e.g. GDPR, CCPA) by [following the instructions for adding secondary ids to the deletion request ping.](https://mozilla.github.io/glean/book/user/pings/deletion_request.html)\r\n\r\nThis will give the user control over their tracked telemetry (linked through legacy telemetry client id) and prevent any further telemetry from being tracked for their account.\r\n\r\n### Impact\r\nRequired by California Privacy Act deadline in June\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
